+          /* The simulator backend cannot probe the real RAM-sizing registers,
+             so sst1InitGetDeviceInfo() may report 0MB. Assume a standard 2MB
+             Voodoo Graphics (2MB FBI + 2MB per TMU) so that texture-memory
